# Help topic "Picking a colour from the screen": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-eye-dropper-step2-2 = The screen is held still, with a magnified circle by the pointer so you can aim at one dot.
# Help topic "Picking a colour from the screen": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-eye-dropper-step2-3 = Click the dot you want. Press Esc to give up instead.
