# Help topic "Language and keyboard": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-language-p2 = The same Keyboard and mouse page sets how fast the pointer and scrolling go, which way scrolling moves the page, and whether the mouse buttons are swapped for the left hand. On a laptop it also has the touchpad: tap to click, and switching the touchpad off while you type. Each change works straight away.
